00:29:02.700 --> 00:29:06.300
more, we're doing actually
quite a bit on TPUs.

00:29:06.300 --> 00:29:08.880
It's so much more
efficient, power efficient,

00:29:08.880 --> 00:29:11.670
compute efficient,
and density-wise

00:29:11.670 --> 00:29:15.300
that we're able to pack so
much more compute into our data

00:29:15.300 --> 00:29:16.180
